                                "sense_id": "b6e778c4-0817-3432-9b47-8f5e93e54413",
                                "text": "Een goede spellingcontrole kan helpen om taalfouten in je tekst op te sporen.",
                                "translation": "A good spell check can help detect language errors in your text.",
